      "title": "Equipe Especial e Cuidadosa ! Estivemos em Casa !",
      "liked": "My stay at Hotel Lisbon Corpo Santo was spectacular! The best thing of all is the people! All the staff were spectacular — always very available, attentive and ready to make our stay distinctive and special! The rooms are comfortable, the restaurant is very good, the location is fantastic and right in the center, the Spa facilities are great and the breakfast delicious! There was always a little treat for us at reception based on Portuguese cuisine, the city tour was very organized and the concierge always had special tips!",
