      "liked": "The staff are perfect! Super attentive and careful with every detail. They took care of us perfectly. The facilities are new and well maintained. We received a massage (Anabela was spectacular!) and several little treats during our stay. At the concierge, Ana and Miguel helped us a lot with fantastic tips for divine restaurants that made our stay even more fantastic! The city tour with Ana was special!",
