      "liked": "The location is perfect for those who want to get to know the city, very central, with many attractions and spectacular restaurants just a few minutes' walk away, which in Lisbon are always very pleasant. The coffee is very good and well presented with many options; everyone is cheerful and willing to exceed our expectations to make our stay perfect. Comfortable and quiet room. Spa with a good sauna and massage.",
